1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,170
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,120
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:15,850
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,010
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,000
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,250
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,520
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,480
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,480
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:44,850
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:47,840
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,690
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,040
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,210
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,290
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,170
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,610
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,050
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,130
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,250
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,210
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:32,850
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,480
Renegade Immortal\NSubtitles by Bonobosubs\Nhttps://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:02:25,800 --> 00:02:28,000
Where is the Fighting Evil Sect Leader ?

25
00:02:40,200 --> 00:02:41,160
Teleportation ?

26
00:02:41,440 --> 00:02:42,560
A Nascent Soul cultivator !

27
00:02:45,760 --> 00:02:48,280
Duanmu Ji\NEight Extremes Devil Lord\NDevil Lord of Qi Mei City\NMiddle stage Soul Formation

28
00:02:51,240 --> 00:02:52,760
Are you the Sect Leader ?

29
00:02:52,360 --> 00:02:53,400
No, no, no !

30
00:02:53,680 --> 00:02:55,240
I am merely his disciple !

31
00:02:56,480 --> 00:02:58,120
So where is he ?

32
00:02:58,680 --> 00:03:00,560
Master has my Soul Blood...

33
00:03:00,960 --> 00:03:02,480
If I reveal his location,

34
00:03:02,720 --> 00:03:04,440
it will be the end for me.

35
00:03:07,240 --> 00:03:08,200
Master...

36
00:03:08,760 --> 00:03:09,680
Master, he...

37
00:03:10,120 --> 00:03:12,040
is traveling far away...

38
00:03:12,760 --> 00:03:14,120
You don't get to decide

39
00:03:14,680 --> 00:03:16,400
whether you speak or not.

40
00:03:31,120 --> 00:03:32,560
Found him.

41
00:03:47,520 --> 00:03:49,520
I hope he'll survive.

42
00:03:50,200 --> 00:03:53,200
If he doesn't, I'll die along with him...

43
00:03:55,760 --> 00:03:57,920
Even with Ma Liang's talented body,

44
00:03:57,920 --> 00:04:00,280
I don't have high hopes of forming a Nascent Soul.

45
00:04:00,600 --> 00:04:01,640
In his memories,

46
00:04:02,280 --> 00:04:03,640
I saw that the Divine Path

47
00:04:03,640 --> 00:04:06,120
of the War God Shrine is a method to form a Nascent Soul.

48
00:04:06,400 --> 00:04:09,360
It would be a shame if I didn't use Ma Liang's identity

49
00:04:09,960 --> 00:04:11,360
to have a glimpse.

50
00:04:14,800 --> 00:04:15,640
Disciple Ma Liang

51
00:04:16,080 --> 00:04:17,640
requests to view the Divine Path.

52
00:04:17,640 --> 00:04:18,880
Identity token.

53
00:04:25,920 --> 00:04:27,040
You can enter.

54
00:04:32,440 --> 00:04:33,240
Wait !

55
00:04:38,400 --> 00:04:39,400
Greetings, Ancestor.

56
00:04:41,320 --> 00:04:42,560
Greetings, Ancestor.

57
00:04:48,680 --> 00:04:50,240
In just a few years,

58
00:04:50,880 --> 00:04:52,560
he actually reached Core Formation ?

59
00:04:54,600 --> 00:04:55,760
The Divine Path

60
00:04:56,240 --> 00:04:58,480
is the secret technique of our War God Shrine.

61
00:04:58,520 --> 00:04:59,400
Are you aware ?

62
00:04:59,800 --> 00:05:00,600
Disciple is aware.

63
00:05:00,960 --> 00:05:02,640
What's the meaning of a secret technique ?

64
00:05:02,920 --> 00:05:04,480
It mustn't be revealed to outsiders.

65
00:05:05,840 --> 00:05:07,760
The Divine Path is profound and mysterious.

66
00:05:08,040 --> 00:05:10,240
It's very beneficial for forming a Nascent Soul.

67
00:05:10,400 --> 00:05:12,760
But this is our War God Hall's secret technique.

68
00:05:13,480 --> 00:05:14,800
A mere Core Formation brat

69
00:05:14,920 --> 00:05:16,520
coveting the Divine Path

70
00:05:16,960 --> 00:05:20,240
should weigh whether he has the capability.

71
00:05:20,320 --> 00:05:22,040
Do you think the Founder of our War God Shrine

72
00:05:22,120 --> 00:05:23,080
will accept you ?

73
00:05:25,320 --> 00:05:26,600
Disciple understands

74
00:05:26,600 --> 00:05:28,040
what Ancestor means.

75
00:05:31,560 --> 00:05:33,560
He's just a rogue cultivator.

76
00:05:33,920 --> 00:05:36,040
So what if he reached Core Formation ?

77
00:05:39,400 --> 00:05:40,400
It seems that

78
00:05:40,640 --> 00:05:42,960
this will take some more scheming...

79
00:05:49,120 --> 00:05:50,440
Little guy,

80
00:05:52,320 --> 00:05:54,640
this old man has finally found you !

81
00:06:03,000 --> 00:06:05,200
This person's cultivation is far above mine.

82
00:06:05,240 --> 00:06:06,040
Who is he ?

83
00:06:07,440 --> 00:06:10,000
Could he be the Ancestor of someone I killed in the Sea of Devils

84
00:06:10,000 --> 00:06:11,640
that's seeking revenge ?

85
00:06:11,880 --> 00:06:13,160
He doesn't have good intentions.

86
00:06:24,880 --> 00:06:26,320
Little guy,

87
00:06:26,320 --> 00:06:28,680
this formation can't protect you.

88
00:06:45,720 --> 00:06:48,440
This formation was made by all the Ancestors of the Burning Fire Alliance

89
00:06:49,120 --> 00:06:50,640
but he easily broke it.

90
00:06:51,560 --> 00:06:53,280
This person's cultivation is truly unfathomable...

91
00:06:54,120 --> 00:06:54,920
Fellow cultivator,

92
00:06:55,360 --> 00:06:57,480
why did you destroy our formation !?

93
00:07:01,760 --> 00:07:02,560
Scram !

94
00:07:20,280 --> 00:07:22,680
Senior is the Devil Lord of Qi Mei City.

95
00:07:23,200 --> 00:07:24,560
A Soul Formation Senior !

96
00:07:30,840 --> 00:07:32,360
This is the last warning.

97
00:07:33,280 --> 00:07:34,400
Let me pass.

98
00:07:46,600 --> 00:07:48,040
He vanished !?

99
00:08:03,000 --> 00:08:05,720
How could the connection to the Soul Blood vanish ?

100
00:08:06,320 --> 00:08:09,400
You absolutely cannot escape my grasp !

101
00:08:15,880 --> 00:08:17,680
What is this Senior doing ?

102
00:08:32,680 --> 00:08:33,760
Divine Sense Lockdown !

103
00:08:34,680 --> 00:08:37,960
This is the signature formation of the Eight Extremes Devil Lord, Duanmu Ji.

104
00:08:37,960 --> 00:08:40,760
From now on, every cultivator entering or leaving Xuanwu

105
00:08:41,040 --> 00:08:43,840
will be under his watch.

106
00:08:45,760 --> 00:08:47,000
Little guy,

107
00:08:47,750 --> 00:08:49,760
I, the Eight Extremes Devil Lord,

108
00:08:49,760 --> 00:08:52,280
will refine the entire country of Xuanwu if I need to

109
00:08:52,720 --> 00:08:54,600
until I find you !

110
00:08:56,080 --> 00:08:57,240
What do we do now ?

111
00:08:59,880 --> 00:09:01,000
Nothing...

112
00:09:01,400 --> 00:09:04,120
Whoever the Eight Extremes Devil Lord is looking for

113
00:09:04,840 --> 00:09:06,920
probably won't survive.

114
00:09:12,960 --> 00:09:14,240
This person's cultivation is high

115
00:09:14,560 --> 00:09:15,800
and he has ill intent.

116
00:09:16,640 --> 00:09:18,600
For now, I am completely powerless to resist him.

117
00:09:19,760 --> 00:09:22,400
The only option now is to find a flaw in his formation

118
00:09:22,400 --> 00:09:23,760
and escape this place !

119
00:09:43,600 --> 00:09:47,360
3 years later

120
00:10:07,040 --> 00:10:07,840
Little Lin,

121
00:10:08,480 --> 00:10:11,440
you can't stay infinitely in the Heaven Defying Bead.

122
00:10:11,960 --> 00:10:14,720
If all these crystals are dim

123
00:10:15,160 --> 00:10:17,520
and the space turns completely black

124
00:10:18,040 --> 00:10:20,360
you will never be able to leave anymore.

125
00:10:21,440 --> 00:10:23,040
If you ever reach that point,

126
00:10:23,320 --> 00:10:25,720
you must stay outside for 3 full days

127
00:10:25,720 --> 00:10:27,120
before you can enter again.

128
00:10:29,240 --> 00:10:31,160
I have looked for 3 years

129
00:10:31,400 --> 00:10:33,400
but only found a single flaw in this formation.

130
00:10:36,320 --> 00:10:37,280
However,

131
00:10:37,960 --> 00:10:40,200
it could very well be a trap.

132
00:10:45,000 --> 00:10:46,080
Enough,

133
00:10:46,200 --> 00:10:47,360
I'll risk it !

134
00:11:11,400 --> 00:11:14,280
How did a mere Core Formation brat do this ?

135
00:11:14,640 --> 00:11:16,680
Completely concealing your aura like that

136
00:11:17,040 --> 00:11:18,840
is truly unbelievable.

137
00:11:19,920 --> 00:11:21,080
Little guy,

138
00:11:21,560 --> 00:11:23,560
I have been waiting for you for 3 years !

139
00:11:24,040 --> 00:11:25,280
How could I be worth

140
00:11:25,280 --> 00:11:26,920
3 years of Senior's time ?

141
00:11:26,920 --> 00:11:28,000
Die !

142
00:11:32,000 --> 00:11:33,680
Why is there no Divine Sense ?

143
00:11:48,160 --> 00:11:49,320
It's said the Death Spell

144
00:11:49,320 --> 00:11:50,960
attacks using Divine Sense.

145
00:12:37,640 --> 00:12:39,560
Senior went through such trouble to capture me.

146
00:12:39,600 --> 00:12:41,360
What do you want from me ?

147
00:12:44,400 --> 00:12:45,720
How do you know

148
00:12:46,200 --> 00:12:48,240
I'm not here to kill you ?

149
00:12:48,720 --> 00:12:49,760
With your cultivation,

150
00:12:50,080 --> 00:12:51,560
you could've killed me in an instant.

151
00:12:52,280 --> 00:12:54,120
But you went to great lengths

152
00:12:54,120 --> 00:12:55,560
to trap me like that.

153
00:12:56,280 --> 00:12:57,200
You...

154
00:12:57,880 --> 00:12:59,480
need something from me !

155
00:13:02,560 --> 00:13:04,800
Interesting, interesting...

156
00:13:05,480 --> 00:13:07,000
What's your name ?

157
00:13:07,600 --> 00:13:08,400
Ma Liang

158
00:13:09,040 --> 00:13:09,880
Ma Liang,

159
00:13:10,520 --> 00:13:11,200
do you

160
00:13:11,960 --> 00:13:13,760
know the Death Spell ?

161
00:13:14,360 --> 00:13:15,600
So he mistook the Ji Realm

162
00:13:16,160 --> 00:13:17,680
for the Death Spell.

163
00:13:20,040 --> 00:13:21,640
Little guy, don't be nervous.

164
00:13:22,600 --> 00:13:25,560
This old man merely wishes to borrow your Death Spell

165
00:13:25,920 --> 00:13:28,440
in order to obtain treasures.

166
00:13:29,080 --> 00:13:31,200
If you agree to accompany me,

167
00:13:31,280 --> 00:13:35,480
I'll give you an Earth Transformation Pill and a Nascent Soul Formation Pill.

168
00:13:41,280 --> 00:13:43,640
You're quite composed for a brat.

169
00:13:44,440 --> 00:13:46,080
This Earth Transformation pill

170
00:13:46,440 --> 00:13:49,400
will help you go from Early to Middle stage Core Formation

171
00:13:49,720 --> 00:13:51,160
with a very high success rate.

172
00:13:51,920 --> 00:13:54,240
This Nascent Soul Formation Pill is even more remarkable.

173
00:13:54,600 --> 00:13:57,560
It's a rare pill that can increase the chance of forming a Nascent Soul.

174
00:13:58,120 --> 00:13:59,400
The recipe for this pill

175
00:13:59,600 --> 00:14:02,440
is only held by rank 5 countries.

176
00:14:03,440 --> 00:14:04,680
I want to know

177
00:14:05,040 --> 00:14:07,320
how dangerous the place we're going to is.

178
00:14:08,680 --> 00:14:10,200
I won't hide it from you

179
00:14:10,880 --> 00:14:14,440
Even if Peak Late stage Nascent Soul cultivators enter it,

180
00:14:14,640 --> 00:14:16,280
they might not make it out alive.

181
00:14:17,600 --> 00:14:20,160
If you're not very careful,

182
00:14:20,360 --> 00:14:22,000
death is inevitable.

183
00:14:22,720 --> 00:14:23,480
But

184
00:14:23,880 --> 00:14:25,520
even if that place is very dangerous,

185
00:14:25,600 --> 00:14:27,240
the rewards are also immense.

186
00:14:27,640 --> 00:14:29,720
Artifacts, pills, spells,

187
00:14:29,720 --> 00:14:31,560
it has everything !

188
00:14:32,320 --> 00:14:33,440
Besides that,

189
00:14:33,840 --> 00:14:36,320
there should even be a Soul Transformation Pill.

190
00:14:36,880 --> 00:14:38,520
With a single pill,

191
00:14:38,800 --> 00:14:40,120
you have a chance

192
00:14:40,120 --> 00:14:42,880
to leap directly to Soul Transformation.

193
00:14:44,000 --> 00:14:45,000
So generous ?

194
00:14:46,240 --> 00:14:47,280
The stakes must be high.

195
00:14:49,720 --> 00:14:51,400
You need not worry

196
00:14:51,840 --> 00:14:53,680
about how dangerous it is.

197
00:14:54,560 --> 00:14:55,880
Your Death Spell

198
00:14:56,000 --> 00:14:58,880
will be of great use in a particular trial.

199
00:14:59,360 --> 00:15:00,240
This old man

200
00:15:00,640 --> 00:15:02,680
will definitely ensure your safety.

201
00:15:03,360 --> 00:15:04,480
If I refuse

202
00:15:05,280 --> 00:15:07,280
he will kill me on the spot.

203
00:15:09,600 --> 00:15:10,800
But 2 pills

204
00:15:11,240 --> 00:15:12,440
are not enough.

205
00:15:14,030 --> 00:15:16,240
If it weren't for the rules of that place

206
00:15:16,280 --> 00:15:17,640
I would have used a restriction

207
00:15:17,640 --> 00:15:19,040
to control you, kid.

208
00:15:23,320 --> 00:15:25,120
This is a Divine Sense mark

209
00:15:25,640 --> 00:15:28,160
to prevent you from disappearing again.

210
00:15:28,840 --> 00:15:30,280
Once we reach that place,

211
00:15:31,080 --> 00:15:33,360
I will naturally remove it.

212
00:15:47,840 --> 00:15:49,560
Who is in charge here ?

213
00:15:49,720 --> 00:15:51,120
What's happening ?

214
00:15:50,040 --> 00:15:51,120
Such a powerful pressure !

215
00:15:51,160 --> 00:15:51,960
Let's see.

216
00:15:58,040 --> 00:15:59,800
The Eight Extremes Devil Lord was looking

217
00:15:59,800 --> 00:16:00,760
for him !?

218
00:16:02,360 --> 00:16:04,280
Since Senior graces us with his presence,

219
00:16:04,480 --> 00:16:06,280
might I ask how we can help you ?

220
00:16:06,280 --> 00:16:09,680
My little friend here is quite interested in your Divine Path.

221
00:16:10,080 --> 00:16:12,120
I wonder if he might have a look ?

222
00:16:13,120 --> 00:16:13,640
This...

223
00:16:13,640 --> 00:16:16,320
The Divine Path is the secret technique of our War God Shrine.

224
00:16:16,320 --> 00:16:17,520
Senior...

225
00:16:16,320 --> 00:16:18,560
I hate asking favors !

226
00:16:18,560 --> 00:16:20,120
It's too troublesome.

227
00:16:20,480 --> 00:16:22,800
I'll just level this sect instead !

228
00:16:24,120 --> 00:16:25,760
Thank you Senior for the reminder.

229
00:16:25,760 --> 00:16:27,480
Ma Liang is indeed a disciple of our War God Shrine.

230
00:16:27,720 --> 00:16:30,160
He is allowed to see the Divine Path at Core Formation.

231
00:16:30,800 --> 00:16:31,240
Ma Liang,

232
00:16:31,840 --> 00:16:32,680
come with me.

233
00:16:40,840 --> 00:16:41,600
Little friend,

234
00:16:41,760 --> 00:16:43,760
I will wait for you outside.

235
00:16:43,840 --> 00:16:45,680
If anything happens to you,

236
00:16:46,080 --> 00:16:48,840
I will make sure every single person here

237
00:16:48,840 --> 00:16:50,480
is buried alongside you !

238
00:17:01,000 --> 00:17:01,800
Ancestor !

239
00:17:10,200 --> 00:17:10,840
Wang Lin,

240
00:17:11,680 --> 00:17:13,440
I forgave you for what happened.

241
00:17:14,200 --> 00:17:15,960
No matter how much trouble you're in,

242
00:17:16,600 --> 00:17:18,560
don't involve our War God Shrine anymore.

243
00:17:19,440 --> 00:17:20,800
If you promise that to me,

244
00:17:21,080 --> 00:17:22,880
I'll open the hall for you

245
00:17:23,480 --> 00:17:25,240
to let you see the Divine Path.

246
00:17:26,400 --> 00:17:27,760
Senior can rest assured.

247
00:17:28,120 --> 00:17:30,600
I will leave after viewing the Divine Path.

248
00:17:30,840 --> 00:17:32,040
and will never return.

249
00:17:45,200 --> 00:17:46,840
This technique is very profound.

250
00:17:47,360 --> 00:17:50,160
Not everyone is fated to learn it.

251
00:17:50,320 --> 00:17:51,320
Or rather

252
00:17:51,520 --> 00:17:53,120
only a very few people

253
00:17:53,600 --> 00:17:54,760
are fated.

254
00:17:55,880 --> 00:17:57,120
What do you mean ?

255
00:17:57,720 --> 00:17:59,720
You'll understand when you see it.

256
00:18:18,120 --> 00:20:40,500
In the novel, the events of the this episode and the previous happen in a different order. Wang Lin doesn't go back to the Fighting Evil Sect after escorting Li Muwan to the Luo River Sect. In fact, the reason he hurries to send her off and refuses to stay with her is because he sensed that he was being chased by Duanmu Ji through a wisp of Divine Sense that he left behind him. He didn't want her to be endangered.\N\NThe Eight Extremes of conceptual elaboration are a philosophical concept of buddhism. Here is the list :\N- arising\N- ceasing\N- being non-existent\N- being permanent\N- coming\N- going\N- being multiple\N- being single

257
00:18:46,980 --> 00:18:53,860
Count the specks of time

258
00:18:50,860 --> 00:18:53,860
floating down gently.

259
00:18:54,220 --> 00:19:00,100
The carving knife in your hands etches out destiny.

260
00:19:01,220 --> 00:19:07,620
Forever lock away the scars

261
00:19:05,020 --> 00:19:07,620
of this mortal life.

262
00:19:07,880 --> 00:19:14,140
This fleeting youth is a thing of the past.

263
00:19:14,780 --> 00:19:21,860
The flying bird could not escape the twilight

264
00:19:17,460 --> 00:19:21,860
that fills the sky with a myriad of colors.

265
00:19:21,940 --> 00:19:29,020
The night-blooming flower cannot drink

266
00:19:23,980 --> 00:19:29,020
the crystalization of the golden wind and the jade dew.

267
00:19:29,460 --> 00:19:31,540
I will ask the heavens who exactly

268
00:19:31,540 --> 00:19:36,300
sliced open this world

269
00:19:32,940 --> 00:19:36,300
to let the rain fall in.

270
00:19:36,300 --> 00:19:38,300
I will refine the world

271
00:19:38,380 --> 00:19:40,820
to make our palm lines say

272
00:19:41,020 --> 00:19:43,180
that we will live forever.

273
00:19:43,180 --> 00:19:46,100
Walking off the beaten path

274
